1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,964
Ghar ka kaam, khet ka kaam, par apni kamai kuch nahi.

2
00:00:04,264 --> 00:00:08,953
Sushila, gobar to tere ghar mein muft hai! Kenchua khad bana, sona ban jaayega!

3
00:00:09,253 --> 00:00:11,884
Kenchue se khad? Didi, kaun kharidega?

4
00:00:12,184 --> 00:00:15,664
Paanch bed, kenchue aur chhaya ka shed. 25 hazaar mein shuru.

5
00:00:15,964 --> 00:00:21,254
Do mahine mein khad taiyaar. Kisaanon ko bori mein, aur sheher walon ko chhote packet mein bech.

6
00:00:21,804 --> 00:00:25,941
Behen ji, meri chhat pe bageecha hai. Organic khad milegi?

7
00:00:26,241 --> 00:00:30,355
Paanch kilo ka packet, 200 rupaye. Aapke paudhe jhoom uthenge!

8
00:00:30,655 --> 00:00:34,599
Har mahine ek-do ton khad, yaani 15 se 20 hazaar ki kamai.

9
00:00:34,899 --> 00:00:38,844
Kenchue bhi bech! Naye kisaan kenchue kharidne aayenge, wo alag kamai.

10
00:00:39,144 --> 00:00:41,860
Gobar se gold! Sushila ki life set!
